Chapter: Atomic
  cites Gpu chapter DeviceEffect

Section: Operations

 A PTX atom with no .sem qualifier is .relaxed (PTX ISA, "Parallel
 Synchronization and Communication Instructions: atom"), so every operation
 here is relaxed. A word is 64 bits at base + 8 * word.

  atom-word : Integer, Integer -> Integer
  atom-word (base) (word) = base + word * 8

  atom-add : Integer, Integer, Integer -> [Device] Integer
  atom-add (base) (word) (v) = device-atomic-add (atom-word base word) v

  atom-cas : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> [Device] Integer
  atom-cas (base) (word) (expected) (v) = device-atomic-cas (atom-word base word) expected v

  atom-exchange : Integer, Integer, Integer -> [Device] Integer
  atom-exchange (base) (word) (v) = device-atomic-exchange (atom-word base word) v

  atom-block-add : Integer, Integer, Integer -> [Device] Integer
  atom-block-add (base) (word) (v) = block-atomic-add (atom-word base word) v

